# Cursor UI Component Patterns — {{ manifest.project_name }}

Always consume the semantic CSS variables from `tokens.css` (`var(--brand-*)`) or the Tailwind theme keys from `tailwind.theme.json` (`bg-brand-*`, `text-brand-*`, `font-display`, `shadow-brand`). **Never hardcode raw HEX literals or inline `style` objects in components.**

## 1. Token-Driven JSX / Tailwind Component Blueprints

### Primary CTA Button (`--brand-accent-primary`)
```tsx
export function BrandButton({ children, ...props }: React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>) {
  return (
    <button
      className="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-3 font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-[var(--brand-accent-primary)] text-[var(--brand-accent-primary-contrast)] rounded-[var(--brand-radius-md)] [border:var(--brand-border)] [box-shadow:var(--brand-shadow)] transition-transform hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
      {...props}
    >
      {children}
    </button>
  );
}
```

### Elevated Feature / Product Card (`--brand-surface-card`)
```tsx
export function BrandCard({ children, className = "" }: { children: React.ReactNode; className?: string }) {
  return (
    <article
      className={`p-6 bg-[var(--brand-surface-card)] text-[var(--brand-surface-card-contrast)] rounded-[var(--brand-radius-lg)] [border:var(--brand-border)] [box-shadow:var(--brand-shadow)] ${className}`}
    >
      {children}
    </article>
  );
}
```

### Stamp / Pill Badge (`--brand-accent-secondary`)
```tsx
export function BrandBadge({ label }: { label: string }) {
  return (
    <span className="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase bg-[var(--brand-accent-secondary)] text-[var(--brand-accent-secondary-contrast)] rounded-[var(--brand-radius-pill)] [border:var(--brand-border)]">
      {label}
    </span>
  );
}
```

## 2. Hard Anti-Patterns
- NEVER hardcode raw HEX strings or inline `style={{ '{{' }} ... {{ '}}' }}` objects when a `--brand-*` token exists.
